
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>
    <%= isApproved ? "Courier Application Approved" : "Courier Application Update" %>
  </title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .header {
      background: #e50914;
      padding: 28px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 40px 35px;
    }

    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      color: #222222;
    }

    .message {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #555555;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

     .status-box {
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  margin: 25px 0;
  border-left: 5px solid #e50914;
}

.status-box.approved {
  background-color: #f0fdf4;
}

.status-box.rejected {
  background-color: #fff1f2;
}

.status-title {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
}

.status-box.approved .status-title {
  color: #166534;
}

.status-box.rejected .status-title {
  color: #b91c1c;
}



    .status-text {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #555555;
    }

    .deadline {
      background: #fafafa;
      padding: 15px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555555;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #fafafa;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888888;
    }

    .brand {
      color: #e50914;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="wrapper">

    <div class="container">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header">
        <h1 class="logo">SwiftCourier</h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="content">

        <div class="greeting">
          Hello <%= name %>,
        </div>

        <% if (isApproved) { %>

          <p class="message">
            Congratulations! We are pleased to inform you that your
            application for the <strong>Courier</strong> role at
            <strong>SwiftCourier</strong> has been approved.
          </p>

          <div class="status-box">
            <p class="status-title">
              Application Approved ✓
            </p>

            <p class="status-text">
              Your courier application has been successfully approved.
              You can now continue with the next steps of your onboarding
              process.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="message">
            Welcome to the <strong>SwiftCourier</strong> team. We look forward
            to working with you and wish you success in your new role.
          </p>

        <% } else { %>

          <p class="message">
            Thank you for your interest in joining
            <strong>SwiftCourier</strong> as a Courier.
          </p>

          <div class="status-box">
            <p class="status-title">
              Application Rejected
            </p>

            <p class="status-text">
              Unfortunately, your application for the Courier role has not
              been approved at this time.
            </p>
          </div>

          <% if (deletionDeadline) { %>
            <div class="deadline">
              <strong>Account Information:</strong><br />
              Your employee account is currently scheduled for suspension
              and deletion according to our application policy.
              Please contact SwiftCourier support if you believe this
              decision was made in error.
            </div>
          <% } %>

          <p class="message">
            We appreciate the time and effort you invested in your
            application. Thank you for considering SwiftCourier.
          </p>

        <% } %>

        <p class="message">
          Best regards,<br />
          <strong class="brand">SwiftCourier Team</strong>
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          This is an automated email from SwiftCourier.
        </p>

        <p>
          © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SwiftCourier. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>

